1. e4 e5 2. f4 exf4 3. Nf3 d6 {The "Bobby Fischer Defence".} 4. d4 g5 5. h4 g4
6. Ng5 ({As 6 Ne5 is not playable and retreats such as 6 Nh2??, 6 Ng1 or Nfd2
hardly to be considered, White has to decide whether to sacrifice his knight by
} 6. Bc4 gxf3 7. Qxf3 {or as in the game on f7.}) 6... h6 7. Nxf7 Kxf7 8. Bxf4
({White's next few moves are interesting. He does not develop in the old style
with} 8. Bc4+ {and Nc3 (a line liable to lead to exchanges) but prefers a more
solid set-up relying on his strong centre pawns and the insecure position of
Black's king as compensation for the knight sacrificed.}) 8... Qe8 {
Threatening 9...Qxe4+, intending to answer 9 Bc4+ with 9...Be6, and with the
stragetical plan of establishing his queen on h5.} 9. Bd3 Nc6 10. c3 Nf6 11.
O-O Kg7 12. Nd2 Qh5 13. Bg3 Be7 14. Qe2 Bd7 15. e5 dxe5 16. dxe5 Rae8 $5 {
The point of Black's defence; he gives back the piece in an attempt to relieve
the pressure and to win White's h-pawn.} 17. exf6+ Bxf6 18. Ne4 $1 ({This self
pin is far superior to} 18. Qf2 $2 Rhf8 {threatening 19...Bd4.}) 18... Bxh4 19.
Bxh4 Qxh4 20. Rf4 $1 {Preventing 20...g3 and preparing to double rooks.} Rhf8
21. Raf1 Rxf4 22. Rxf4 Re7 23. Qe3 {White intends to drive away Black's knight
and then play Qd4+.} b6 24. b4 Qh5 25. b5 Ne5 26. Qd4 {Now Black is under
great pressure, the immediate threat being 27 Nf6.} Qg6 $1 {A good parry: if
27 Nf6?? Qxd3.} 27. Bc4 Bf5 28. Ng3 Bd7 29. a4 {The idea if Bd5 and Be4. The
move played is hardly essential but it emphasises Black's difficulties for he
has no good move. Tan was now in considerable time trouble.} Kh7 30. Bd5 Qg5
31. Rf8 h5 32. Ne4 Qh4 {Now that all White's pieces are placed to their
maximum efficiency Black's position is quite hopeless.} 33. Nf6+ Kg7 34. Nxd7
Rxd7 {Black overstepped the time limit. Sources: CHESS/28/424-425 February
1963, p115; The Times, 7 January 1963; BCM, March 1963, p87 (n.b. the game was
postponed from 27 December, until the first rest day, Monday 31 December,
because Tan was delayed at Heathrow Airport.)} 1-0

